menu "OLED display (SSD1306 64x48, I2C)"

    config OLED_DISPLAY_SDA_GPIO
        int "SDA GPIO (-1 = no display)"
        range -1 48
        default -1
        help
            I2C data pin of the 0.66" 64x48 SSD1306 OLED. GPIO 41 is free
            on the default pin map. Do not share the camera's SCCB pins.

    config OLED_DISPLAY_SCL_GPIO
        int "SCL GPIO (-1 = no display)"
        range -1 48
        default -1
        help
            I2C clock pin of the OLED. GPIO 42 is free on the default pin
            map.

    config OLED_DISPLAY_RESET_GPIO
        int "Reset (RS/RST) GPIO (-1 = pin tied to 3V3)"
        range -1 48
        default -1
        help
            SSD1306 reset pin, active low. The firmware pulses it low at
            start, then holds it high. GPIO 40 is free on the default pin
            map. With -1, tie the pin to 3V3: left open, the screen stays
            dark.

    config OLED_DISPLAY_I2C_ADDRESS
        hex "I2C address"
        range 0x3C 0x3D
        default 0x3C
        help
            0x3C on most modules; 0x3D when the address jumper is moved.

    config OLED_DISPLAY_ROTATE_180
        bool "Rotate 180 degrees"
        default n
        help
            Turn on when the text shows upside down.

endmenu
